---
// Footer Component
---

<footer class="bg-brand-blue text-white">
    <!-- Main Footer -->
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 lg:py-16">
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8 lg:gap-12">
            <!-- Company Info -->
            <div class="lg:col-span-2">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
                    <img
                        src="/logo.png"
                        alt="禾騰技術"
                        class="h-10 w-auto brightness-0 invert"
                    />
                    <div>
                        <span class="text-lg font-bold">禾騰技術</span>
                        <span class="block text-sm text-white/70"
                            >hetengtech</span
                        >
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="text-white/80 leading-relaxed max-w-md">
                    帶著回饋土地的使命，運用工程結合新科技，搭配自然與文化的涵養，解決跨領域的複雜議題。
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Quick Links -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-4">快速連結</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-2 text-white/80">
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="/about"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >關於禾騰</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="/services"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >專業服務</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="/portfolio"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >實績案例</a
                        >
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <a
                            href="/careers"
                            class="hover:text-white transition-colors"
                            >加入我們</a
                        >
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <!-- Contact Info -->
            <div>
                <h4 class="font-semibold mb-4">聯絡資訊</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-3 text-white/80">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
                        <svg
                            class="w-5 h-5 mt-0.5 shrink-0"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M17.657 16.657L13.414 20.9a1.998 1.998 0 01-2.827 0l-4.244-4.243a8 8 0 1111.314 0z"
                            ></path>
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M15 11a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path>
                        </svg>
                        <span>新北市新莊區新北大道三段7號2樓6A</span>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <svg
                            class="w-5 h-5 shrink-0"
                            fill="none"
                            stroke="currentColor"
                            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        >
                            <path
                                stroke-linecap="round"
                                stroke-linejoin="round"
                                stroke-width="2"
                                d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"
                            ></path>
                        </svg>
                        <span>02-8521-9296</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Copyright -->
    <div class="border-t border-white/10">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 py-6">
            <div
                class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-center gap-4 text-sm text-white/60"
            >
                <p>
                    © {new Date().getFullYear()} 禾騰技術股份有限公司 All rights reserved.
                </p>
                <p>成立於 2012 年</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
